<title>JAPAN: Indonesia Mar Minas calculated $19.24/bbl-traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Mar Minas calculated $19.24/bbl-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for March lifting was calculated at $19.24 per barrel, down $2.12 from February, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		  MARCH	   FEB</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  19.91	  21.50</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	20.00	  21.25</p>
<p> Attaka		   20.77	  22.25</p>
<p> Cinta		    18.52	  20.65</p>
<p> Duri		     17.63	  19.80</p>
<p> Handil		   19.32	  21.13</p>
<p> Lalang		   19.19	  21.16</p>
<p> Widuri		   18.39	  20.54</p>
<p> Belida		   20.83	  22.36</p>
<p>    TYPE		  MARCH	   FEB</p>
<p> Anoa		     21.17	  22.65</p>
<p> Badak		    20.77	  22.25</p>
<p> Bekapai		  20.77	  22.25</p>
<p> Bunyu		    19.54	  21.06</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     20.25	  20.35</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    20.20	  21.05</p>
<p> Walio		    19.44	  21.16</p>
</text>
